turns.response:
I was really happy. I felt like if life got any better than it already is, i'd explode from the sheer wonderfulness of it all! But then this happened to me today....and now my whole mood has been ruined -_-;;
Okay so for some background info: I was almost killed once when 2 cars collided in front of mine and the debris came flying towards me. The only thing that saved us from certain death is that my dad peeled out to avoid hitting their car (and i'd like to think he did it at just THE right time).
Well today, I was going down a hill on the highway and there were three cars in front of me. Now usually when you see 3-4+ vehicles behind you its best not to

slow down or stop at all, because they'll just rear-end you.
So this car comes up behind us and slows to a complete halt (in front of me) on the highway without any warning whatsoever! I had no time to brake or anything, so my dad takes it out in his own hands by swerving into another lane where there were 2-3 cars. He was literally inches away from a head on collision!!!
He then yells at me and says "I told you not to slow down!!". I just say he should of been more careful, but i'm sure it wasn't his fault -.-;;;
